{
  "label": "Reactions Management",
  "category": "Stop-List",
  "sections": [
    {
      "type": "tutorial",
      "heading": "Stop List Reactions",
      "id": "reactions",
      "intro": "Reactions adalah tindakan otomatis yang dipicu ketika Stop List entry aktif memblokir transaksi. Setiap Stop List entry dapat memiliki multiple reactions dengan berbagai action types seperti SET_RESPCODE, EMAIL_NOTIFICATION, ATTR_WHITE_LIST, ATTR_STOP_LIST, atau ATTR_WATCH_LIST.",
      "steps": [
        {
          "num": 1,
          "title": "Mengakses Reactions Portal",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Dari Detail Panel Stop List, klik tombol **View Reactions**\n• Dialog drawer 1400px terbuka dengan title Attribute Type dan badges\n• Tab **Reactions** menampilkan dataset lengkap reaction entries\n• Toolbar: **Search**, **Add**, **Edit**, **Delete**",
          "color": "#8b5cf6",
          "bg": "#f5f3ff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style='display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;min-height:200px'><div style='font-family:system-ui;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 8px 24px rgba(139,92,246,.12);border:1px solid #e9d5ff;background:#fff;width:360px'><div style='padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #e9d5ff;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f5f3ff,#ede9fe)'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:10px'><div style='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center'><div style='width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:8px;background:#8b5cf6;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center'><svg width='16' height='16' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='white' stroke-width='2.5'><path d='M12 2.69l5.66 5.66a8 8 0 11-11.31 0z'/><line x1='12' y1='8' x2='12' y2='12'/><line x1='12' y1='16' x2='12.01' y2='16'/></svg></div><div><div style='font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a'>Card Number</div><div style='font-size:10px;color:#64748b'>4111****1111</div></div></div><span style='padding:3px 8px;border-radius:12px;background:#ede9fe;border:1px solid #e9d5ff;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#7c3aed'>Stop List</span></div><div style='display:flex;gap:8px'><div style='padding:6px 12px;border-radius:16px;background:#fff;border:2px solid #8b5cf6;font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#8b5cf6;box-shadow:0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.05)'>⚡ Reactions</div><div style='padding:6px 12px;border-radius:16px;background:transparent;border:1px solid #e9d5ff;font-size:10px;font-weight:600;color:#a78bfa'>📊 History</div></div></div><div style='padding:14px 16px'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-bottom:10px'><div style='font-size:10px;font-weight:800;color:#0f172a'>Reaction Dataset</div><div style='display:flex;gap:6px'><div style='padding:4px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#64748b'>🔍</div><div style='padding:4px 8px;border-radius:6px;background:#8b5cf6;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#fff'>+ Add</div></div></div><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px'><div style='background:#faf5ff;border:1px solid #e9d5ff;border-left:3px solid #8b5cf6;border-radius:8px;padding:10px'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;margin-bottom:4px'><div style='flex:1'><div style='font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a'>Set Response Code</div><div style='font-size:8px;color:#64748b'>ID: #12345678</div></div><span style='padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#dbeafe;font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#2563eb'>Priority: 8</span></div><div style='font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:4px'>Set ISO response code to 05</div><div style='font-size:7px;color:#94a3b8'>Action: SET_RESPCODE</div></div><div style='background:#faf5ff;border:1px solid #e9d5ff;border-left:3px solid #a78bfa;border-radius:8px;padding:10px'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:start;margin-bottom:4px'><div style='flex:1'><div style='font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a'>Email Notification</div><div style='font-size:8px;color:#64748b'>ID: #87654321</div></div><span style='padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#dbeafe;font-size:7px;font-weight:700;color:#2563eb'>Priority: 5</span></div><div style='font-size:8px;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:4px'>Alert fraud team on block</div><div style='font-size:7px;color:#94a3b8'>Action: EMAIL_NOTIFICATION</div></div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 2,
          "title": "Action Types & Use Cases",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n**1. SET_RESPCODE** - Ubah ISO 8583 response code\n**2. EMAIL_NOTIFICATION** - Kirim alert ke recipient/group\n**3. ATTR_WHITE_LIST** - Auto-add ke White List\n**4. ATTR_STOP_LIST** - Cascade blocking related attributes\n**5. ATTR_WATCH_LIST** - Add ke Watch List untuk monitoring\n**6. CREATE_ACQUIRER_ALERT / CREATE_ISSUER_ALERT** - Alert ke external system",
          "color": "#06b6d4",
          "bg": "#ecfeff",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style='display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;min-height:200px'><div style='font-family:system-ui;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(6,182,212,.12);border:1px solid #cffafe;background:#fff;width:340px'><div style='padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #cffafe;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ecfeff,#cffafe)'><div style='font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin-bottom:4px'>Reaction Action Types</div><div style='font-size:9px;color:#64748b'>Available automation actions</div></div><div style='padding:14px 16px'><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px'><div style='background:#f0f9ff;border:1px solid #e0f2fe;border-radius:8px;padding:10px'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:4px'><div style='width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:#06b6d4;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px'>🚫</div><div style='font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a'>SET_RESPCODE</div></div><div style='font-size:8px;color:#64748b'>Change ISO 8583 response code</div></div><div style='background:#f0fdf4;border:1px solid #dcfce7;border-radius:8px;padding:10px'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:4px'><div style='width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:#10b981;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px'>📧</div><div style='font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a'>EMAIL_NOTIFICATION</div></div><div style='font-size:8px;color:#64748b'>Send alert to team</div></div><div style='background:#fef3c7;border:1px solid #fde68a;border-radius:8px;padding:10px'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:4px'><div style='width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:#f59e0b;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px'>📋</div><div style='font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a'>ATTR Actions</div></div><div style='font-size:8px;color:#64748b'>WHITE_LIST, STOP_LIST, WATCH_LIST</div></div><div style='background:#fdf2f8;border:1px solid #fce7f3;border-radius:8px;padding:10px'><div style='display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;margin-bottom:4px'><div style='width:24px;height:24px;border-radius:6px;background:#ec4899;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:11px'>🔔</div><div style='font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a'>Alert Actions</div></div><div style='font-size:8px;color:#64748b'>ACQUIRER_ALERT, ISSUER_ALERT</div></div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 3,
          "title": "Add & Edit Reaction",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n**Core Fields (semua action):**\n• **Priority** (1-10): Slider urutan eksekusi\n• **Description**: Penjelasan reaction\n• **Action**: Dropdown action type\n\n**Conditional Fields per Action:**\n• **SET_RESPCODE**: Response Code dropdown\n• **EMAIL_NOTIFICATION**: Recipient Type, Contact, Template\n• **ATTR_***: Attribute, Date From/To, Reason\n• **CREATE_*_ALERT**: Core fields only",
          "color": "#f59e0b",
          "bg": "#fffbeb",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style='display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;min-height:200px'><div style='font-family:system-ui;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(245,158,11,.12);border:1px solid #fde68a;background:#fff;width:300px'><div style='padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #fef3c7;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fffbeb,#fef3c7)'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center'><div style='display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center'><div style='width:32px;height:32px;border-radius:8px;background:#f59e0b;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center'><svg width='16' height='16' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='white' stroke-width='2.5'><path d='M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z'/></svg></div><div><div style='font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a'>Create Reaction</div><div style='font-size:9px;color:#64748b'>Configure action</div></div></div><span style='padding:3px 8px;border-radius:12px;background:#fef3c7;border:1px solid #fde68a;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#d97706'>Add</span></div></div><div style='padding:14px 16px'><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px'><div><div style='font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;margin-bottom:6px'>Priority <span style='color:#ef4444'>*</span></div><div style='position:relative;height:28px;background:#f3f4f6;border-radius:8px'><div style='position:absolute;left:0;top:0;bottom:0;width:80%;background:linear-gradient(90deg,#f59e0b,#d97706);border-radius:8px'></div><div style='position:absolute;left:80%;top:50%;transform:translate(-50%,-50%);width:14px;height:14px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;border:2px solid #f59e0b;box-shadow:0 2px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.15)'></div></div><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;margin-top:3px;font-size:7px;color:#94a3b8;font-weight:600'><span>1</span><span>5</span><span>10</span></div></div><div><div style='font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;margin-bottom:4px'>Description <span style='color:#ef4444'>*</span></div><div style='padding:8px 10px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:8px;font-size:9px;color:#94a3b8;min-height:40px'>Enter description...</div></div><div><div style='font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;margin-bottom:4px'>Action <span style='color:#ef4444'>*</span></div><div style='padding:8px 10px;border:1.5px solid #f59e0b;border-radius:8px;font-size:10px;color:#0f172a;background:#fffbeb;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center'>Set Response Code<svg width='12' height='12' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='2'><polyline points='6 9 12 15 18 9'/></svg></div></div><div><div style='font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;margin-bottom:4px'>Response Code <span style='color:#ef4444'>*</span></div><div style='padding:8px 10px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:8px;font-size:10px;color:#94a3b8;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center'>Select code<svg width='12' height='12' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='2'><polyline points='6 9 12 15 18 9'/></svg></div></div></div></div><div style='padding:12px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f8fafc;display:flex;gap:8px'><button style='flex:1;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#475569;font-size:10px;font-weight:700'>Cancel</button><button style='flex:1;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;background:#f59e0b;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:700'>Create</button></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 4,
          "title": "Reaction Details & History",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik reaction row untuk buka detail panel\n• Tab **General**: Semua field + JSON actionValue\n• Tab **History**: Timeline audit perubahan\n\n**Action Value Format:**\n```json\n// EMAIL_NOTIFICATION\n{\"recipientType\":\"RECIPIENT\",\"recipient\":\"123\",\"templateId\":\"456\"}\n\n// ATTR_WATCH_LIST\n{\"attributeId\":789,\"listId\":42,\"dateIn\":\"2024-01-01\",\"isExpired\":true}\n```",
          "color": "#ec4899",
          "bg": "#fdf2f8",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style='display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;min-height:200px'><div style='font-family:system-ui;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(236,72,153,.12);border:1px solid #fce7f3;background:#fff;width:320px'><div style='padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #fce7f3;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fdf2f8,#fce7f3)'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center'><div><div style='font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a'>Reaction Details</div><div style='font-size:9px;color:#64748b'>ID: #12345678</div></div><div style='display:flex;gap:6px'><div style='padding:5px 10px;border-radius:14px;background:#fff;border:2px solid #ec4899;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#ec4899'>General</div><div style='padding:5px 10px;border-radius:14px;background:transparent;border:1px solid #fce7f3;font-size:9px;font-weight:600;color:#f9a8d4'>History</div></div></div></div><div style='padding:14px 16px'><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px'><div style='background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;padding:10px'><div style='font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;margin-bottom:3px'>Action</div><div style='font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a'>SET_RESPCODE</div></div><div style='background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;padding:10px'><div style='font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;margin-bottom:3px'>Description</div><div style='font-size:10px;color:#0f172a'>Set ISO response code to 05 (Do Not Honor)</div></div><div style='background:#f8fafc;border:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-radius:8px;padding:10px'><div style='font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;margin-bottom:3px'>Priority</div><div style='font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#ec4899'>8</div></div><div style='background:#fef3c7;border:1px solid #fde68a;border-radius:8px;padding:10px'><div style='font-size:8px;color:#94a3b8;margin-bottom:4px'>Action Value (JSON)</div><div style='font-family:monospace;font-size:8px;color:#0f172a;line-height:1.4'>{<br/>  \"responseCode\": \"05\"<br/>}</div></div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 5,
          "title": "Search & Filter Reactions",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n• Klik **Search Reaction** untuk buka search panel 320px\n• Filter by **Action**: Dropdown action type\n• Button **Reset**: Clear filters\n• Button **Apply Filters**: Execute search\n\n**Use Cases:**\n• Audit response code usage (SET_RESPCODE)\n• Review alert config (EMAIL_NOTIFICATION)\n• Monitor strategy review (ATTR_WATCH_LIST)",
          "color": "#10b981",
          "bg": "#f0fdf4",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style='display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;min-height:200px'><div style='font-family:system-ui;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(16,185,129,.12);border:1px solid #d1fae5;background:#fff;width:280px'><div style='padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #d1fae5;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f0fdf4,#d1fae5)'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center'><div><div style='font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a'>Search Reactions</div><div style='font-size:9px;color:#64748b'>Filter by criteria</div></div><span style='padding:3px 8px;border-radius:12px;background:#d1fae5;border:1px solid #a7f3d0;font-size:9px;font-weight:700;color:#059669'>🔍</span></div></div><div style='padding:14px 16px'><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px'><div><div style='font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;margin-bottom:6px'>Action Type</div><div style='padding:8px 10px;border:1.5px solid #10b981;border-radius:8px;font-size:10px;color:#0f172a;background:#f0fdf4;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center'>SET_RESPCODE<svg width='12' height='12' viewBox='0 0 24 24' fill='none' stroke='#94a3b8' stroke-width='2'><polyline points='6 9 12 15 18 9'/></svg></div></div><div><div style='font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#374151;margin-bottom:6px'>Priority Range</div><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:6px'><div style='padding:8px 10px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:8px;font-size:9px;color:#94a3b8;text-align:center'>Min: 1</div><div style='padding:8px 10px;border:1.5px solid #cbd5e1;border-radius:8px;font-size:9px;color:#94a3b8;text-align:center'>Max: 10</div></div></div><div style='background:#eff6ff;border:1px solid #dbeafe;border-radius:8px;padding:8px'><div style='font-size:8px;color:#3b82f6;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:3px'>📊 Results Preview</div><div style='font-size:9px;color:#64748b'>Found 3 reactions matching criteria</div></div></div></div><div style='padding:12px 16px;border-top:1px solid #e2e8f0;background:#f8fafc;display:flex;gap:8px'><button style='flex:1;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;color:#475569;font-size:10px;font-weight:700'>Reset</button><button style='flex:1;padding:8px;border-radius:8px;background:#10b981;border:none;color:#fff;font-size:10px;font-weight:700'>Apply</button></div></div></div>"
          }
        },
        {
          "num": 6,
          "title": "Execution Priority & Order",
          "desc": "{previewHtml:1}\n**Priority Range:** 1 (lowest) - 10 (highest)\n\n**Best Practice Assignment:**\n• **9-10 (Critical)**: SET_RESPCODE, CREATE_ACQUIRER_ALERT\n• **6-8 (High)**: EMAIL_NOTIFICATION, ATTR_STOP_LIST\n• **3-5 (Medium)**: ATTR_WATCH_LIST, CREATE_ISSUER_ALERT\n• **1-2 (Low)**: ATTR_WHITE_LIST, Logging\n\n> Hindari priority sama untuk reactions dengan dependency",
          "color": "#ef4444",
          "bg": "#fef2f2",
          "previewHtml": {
            "1": "<div style='display:flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;min-height:200px'><div style='font-family:system-ui;border-radius:12px;box-shadow:0 6px 20px rgba(239,68,68,.12);border:1px solid #fecaca;background:#fff;width:320px'><div style='padding:12px 16px;border-bottom:1px solid #fecaca;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#fef2f2,#fee2e2)'><div style='font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a;margin-bottom:4px'>Priority Execution Order</div><div style='font-size:9px;color:#64748b'>Higher priority runs first</div></div><div style='padding:14px 16px'><div style='display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:8px'><div style='background:#fee2e2;border:1px solid #fecaca;border-left:3px solid #ef4444;border-radius:8px;padding:10px'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:4px'><div style='flex:1'><div style='font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a'>Critical Priority</div><div style='font-size:8px;color:#64748b'>SET_RESPCODE, ACQUIRER_ALERT</div></div><span style='padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#ef4444;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#fff'>9-10</span></div></div><div style='background:#fed7aa;border:1px solid #fdba74;border-left:3px solid #f97316;border-radius:8px;padding:10px'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:4px'><div style='flex:1'><div style='font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a'>High Priority</div><div style='font-size:8px;color:#64748b'>EMAIL_NOTIFICATION, STOP_LIST</div></div><span style='padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#f97316;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#fff'>6-8</span></div></div><div style='background:#dbeafe;border:1px solid #bfdbfe;border-left:3px solid #3b82f6;border-radius:8px;padding:10px'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:4px'><div style='flex:1'><div style='font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a'>Medium Priority</div><div style='font-size:8px;color:#64748b'>WATCH_LIST, ISSUER_ALERT</div></div><span style='padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#3b82f6;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#fff'>3-5</span></div></div><div style='background:#e2e8f0;border:1px solid #cbd5e1;border-left:3px solid #64748b;border-radius:8px;padding:10px'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:4px'><div style='flex:1'><div style='font-size:10px;font-weight:700;color:#0f172a'>Low Priority</div><div style='font-size:8px;color:#64748b'>WHITE_LIST, Logging</div></div><span style='padding:2px 6px;border-radius:4px;background:#64748b;font-size:8px;font-weight:700;color:#fff'>1-2</span></div></div></div></div></div></div>"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
